{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"fileName":"InMemoryDestination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination.swift#L27"},"title":"InMemoryDestination","externalID":"s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV","roleHeading":"Structure"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InvalidCapacity"],"anchor":"Destinations","title":"Destinations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deliver to it beside the destinations that send events away, then read what arrived: an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-app event inspector or debug drawer listing what was just tracked, a recent-activity view,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a SwiftUI preview fed sample events, or a test checking what its code tracked."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let destination = try InMemoryDestination(capacity: 500)","let tracker = Tracker()","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","await tracker.finish()","try await tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: destination).execute()","destination.events(of: SignedUp.self)  \/\/ [SignedUp(plan: \"pro\")]"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type